{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:39 2026-11-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:39 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:39 2026-11-01 HKT</p><img alt=\"蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afa3f889cde6c4ab9445d3017f6e255b/2026-11/2026-10-31_23_22_03.png\"/><p>一股偏東氣流正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶覆蓋該區。</p><p>本港地區今日大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。日間短暫時間有陽光，最高氣溫約29度。吹和緩偏東風，初時離岸風勢間中清勁。</p><img alt=\"本港地區今日大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e43c67464669ca51bad54cb9057e0342/2026-11/43.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be50f1717feb40fc92b4672559adcafc/2026-11/2026-10-31_23_36_16.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c76ad0aadf6dcfe752d2855d5bdff995/2026-11/2026-10-31_23_36_24.png\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/edc66a2f30ba5d53e997d0450054eafb/2026-11/44.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"本港地區今日大致多雲，初時有一兩陣微雨。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5dd128222834cfea83220a3eca65b51b/2026-11/45.jpeg\"/><p>展望明日部分時間有陽光。隨後一兩日風勢較大。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:06.727993+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":190,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T23:39:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:41.677549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:02.527786+00:00","content_hash":"effc320270d1f08c7dd5ea970fd204a08947a7f5881fd411e30d53d51812739d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}